# ==============================================================================
# Database: L4 p0f v3 TCP SYN Operating System Signatures
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   TTL Tier (32/64/128/255) | TCP Options Layout | WScale | Win | OS Name | Score (1-99) | Device Type | Vendor
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Strict Specificity Order:
#      a. Exact WScale & Exact Window Size (e.g. 8|64240)
#      b. Exact WScale OR Exact Window Size (e.g. 8|* or *|8192)
#      c. Options layout matches (e.g. ^mss,nop,ws,sok,ts|*|*)
#      d. Fallbacks with wildcards (*|*|*) ALWAYS at the very bottom of each TTL block.
#   2. Printer patterns MUST precede gaming consoles to avoid false matches.
#
# Example:
#   128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|8|64240|Windows|94|pc|Microsoft
#   64|^mss,sok,ts,nop,ws|10|65535|Android|94|smartphone|Android
# ==============================================================================

# ==============================================================================
# Windows NT Kernel Family (TTL 128)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Exact WS & Exact Window Size
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|8|64240|Windows|94|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,sok,ts|8|64240|Windows|92|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|8|65535|Windows|90|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|8|8192|Windows Server|88|server|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,sok,ts|8|8192|Windows Server|86|server|Microsoft

# 2. Semi-Specific (Exact Win or Exact WS)
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|*|8192|Windows Server|84|server|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|8|*|Windows|90|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,sok,ts|8|*|Windows|88|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,sok|8|*|Windows|86|pc|Microsoft

# 3. Generic Pattern Matches
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,sok|*|*|Windows|88|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,sok,ts|*|*|Windows|86|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,sok|*|*|Windows|84|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,nop,sok|*|*|Windows (Legacy)|80|pc|Microsoft
128|^mss,nop,ws,nop,nop,ts,eol|*|*|Windows|78|pc|Microsoft

# 4. TTL 128 Fallback
128|*|*|*|Windows|60|pc|Microsoft


